      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This just sounds like more annoyance to me. Instead of adjusting our head position everytime we lie down, maybe vrchats IK should put matching our heads position at a higher priority than everything else.\n\nAt current vrchat seems to think the hips are more important to have in the right position than the head. They should fix the IK, then implement adjustments.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
