      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Until this is fixed on VRC's side, there's a YouTube video out there that shows how to \"fix\" it in Blender/Unity: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IqUVFuSD5a4\nUsually it's caused by the avatar being out of proportion from your meatspace body.  For MMDs, it's usually because the legs are insanely long.",
      "viewerReactions": null
